  "schema": "omnibias/farm-ratios/v1",
  "what": "Interop: omnibias's folx drop-in and planner against folx.forward_laplacian (tanh MLP D -> 64 -> 64 -> 64 -> 1, jit(vmap), float64), and the DeepXDE and PINA adapters against the libraries' own operators (loss mean(laplacian^2) and its gradient with respect to the parameters, float64)",
