  "protocol": "one fresh process per cell, median of nine calls; ratio = baseline time / omnibias time; the interval is the ratio divided and multiplied by 1.10 (a noise band, not a bootstrap). The first call of the folx drop-in is measured in paired fresh-process rounds (omnibias, folx; each round one process per program) with the 95 % bootstrap over rounds",
